name[play]: All plays should be named.
ans/play.yml:1:3

command-instead-of-shell: Use shell only when shell functionality is required.
ans/play.yml:3 Task/Handler: shell echo hi

fqcn[action-core]: Use FQCN for builtin module actions (shell).
ans/play.yml:3:7 Use `ansible.builtin.shell` or `ansible.legacy.shell` instead.

name[missing]: All tasks should be named.
ans/play.yml:3 Task/Handler: shell echo hi

no-changed-when: Commands should not change things if nothing needs doing.
ans/play.yml:3 Task/Handler: shell echo hi

fqcn[action-core]: Use FQCN for builtin module actions (command).
ans/play.yml:4:7 Use `ansible.builtin.command` or `ansible.legacy.command` instead.

